  "title": "Join us on Friday, April 24th, 2026 for our next session of the Public Webinar Series!",
  "summary": "In this session, UniProt will present recent work and collaborations advancing AI-driven biomedical discovery.",
  "bodyHtml": "<p><strong>UniProt and Common Fund Data Ecosystem Partnership for AI-Driven Biomedical Discovery</strong><br />📅 Friday, April 24, 2026<br />⏰ 1:00–2:00 PM ET</p><p>In this session, UniProt will present recent work and collaborations advancing AI-driven biomedical discovery.</p><p><strong>Topics will include:</strong><br />🧬 A knowledge graph for data integration and knowledge discovery<br />🧪 An introduction to the Protein Knowledge Network (ProKN) and key use cases<br />🔗 Integration of ProKN and CFDE within the NSF Proto-OKN initiative</p><p><strong>Hear from speakers:</strong><br />Cathy Wu, Professor, University of Delaware<br />Chuming Chen, Professor, University of Delaware<br />Manju Anandakrishnan, Data Scientist, University of Delaware<br />Karen Ross, Professor, Georgetown University<br /><br /><img class=\"an1\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;height:1.2em;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;vertical-align:middle;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/1f4bb/32.png\" alt=\"💻\" width=\"1.2em\" data-emoji=\"💻\" aria-label=\"💻\" draggable=\"false\" loading=\"lazy\" /><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(34, 34, 34);display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:norm